ame. But maybe avoid too many placeholders? Need formal letter. About 350 words. Let's draft around 350. Need count. Let's write.\n\n[Date]\n\n[Vendor Contact Name]\n[Vendor Company Name]\n[Address]\n\nDear [Vendor Contact Name],\n\nI am writing on behalf of [Company Name] to request early access to the developer program for your upcoming GPU. [Company Name] is a small software company that builds an open-source inference engine for deploying machine-learning models on heterogeneous hardware. Our engine is used by researchers and engineering teams to run transformer, vision, and multimodal workloads with minimal integration effort, and we are preparing a major release that will include support for your new architecture.\n\nEarly access matters to us because our development schedule depends on stable driver behavior, compiler tooling, profiling interfaces, and documented programming models. If we can evaluate the GPU before general launch, we can identify compatibility issues, optimize kernels, and provide guidance to our users before the product becomes widely available. This is especially important for an open-source project, where early feedback can shape the public release and reduce the burden on your support team after launch.\n\nIn return for early access, we are prepared to provide structured and useful feedback. We will share performance benchmarks for representative inference workloads, including latency,", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0011181524023413658], [760, -7.963497638702393]], [[1144, -7.74863383412594e-06], [513, -12.642614364624023]], [[4087, -0.27075105905532837], [310, -1.540907859802246]], [[1156, -0.0004502952506300062], [310, -7.8240509033203125]], [[579, -0.016499165445566177], [25, -4.5584797859191895]], [[1622, -0.0015263876412063837], [4237, -6.504353046417236]], [[25, -0.3474466800689697], [13, -1.2274668216705322]], [[3165, -0.07066694647073746], [9357, -3.3032243251800537]], [[15440, -0.1581265777349472], [264, -1.9224812984466553]], [[6321, -9